    <task id="LOCAL-00003" summary="Refactor and modernize API for configuration uploads&#10;&#10;This commit introduces several significant updates to the project structure and functionality:&#10;&#10;- Bumped the project version from 1.0-SNAPSHOT to 1.1.0 and updated the group ID.&#10;- Refactored file serving logic in `Exchange.java` to properly throw `IOException` instead of internal logging/handling, ensuring proper exception propagation.&#10;- Replaced the old `/setLogo` endpoint with a robust `/api/setConfig` endpoint to handle multipart file uploads for configuration.&#10;- Added validation to ensure uploaded files are only PNG or JPEG formats, and implemented safe saving for configurations.&#10;- Updated logging behavior in various places for clearer debugging.">
